			title: "Warp Stone"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4707632A61002DA6"]
			description: ["A warp stone in stone bricks and obsidian. Use a &6Waystone&r once to remember it, then use any waystone to jump to any other you know. Villages often have one already."]
